     [ArmLeft [[Swing -11.4592]]]
     [ArmRight [[Swing 54.431]]]
     [LegLeft [[Swing -17.1887]]]
     [LegRight [[Swing -14.3239]]]]]]]

 ; rocked back by a blow - head thrown up, forelegs buckling apart
 [Pose Struck
